      <h1 class="doc-h1" id="top">AI Model Presentation &amp; Selection Plan</h1>

      <p class="doc-intro">
        How Comserv decides <em>which</em> AI models to show a given user on a given
        page, what each one costs, and which one is pre-selected. Supersedes the
        ad-hoc per-page JS model lists removed during the August 2026 chat-widget
        regression fix.
      </p>

